WEBVTT

00:00:00.353 --> 00:00:09.548
Leave the title blank and describe the task. Automatic titles now fit the kind of request. For a reviewer workflow, the title names the role and what that person should be able to do.

00:00:10.503 --> 00:00:19.954
A bug gets the component, a dash, and the actual fault. The export title keeps the empty download and the reload condition, so the problem is recognizable at a glance.

00:00:20.908 --> 00:00:27.189
For new behaviour, the title says what the component should do. Ordinary notes about a label filter become a clear request for Search.

00:00:28.536 --> 00:00:37.023
A task without a role or component keeps a simple action title. All three formats are available automatically, with the task description preserved below.
